  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Insatsens utvecklingsm&#xe5;l &#xe4;r att f&#xf6;rh&#xf6;ja den administrativa,  organisatoriska och tekniska kapaciteten inom SC i ett led att effektivisera revisionsarbetet i Litauen. Projektm&#xe5;let &#xe4;r att skapa f&#xf6;ruts&#xe4;ttningar f&#xf6;r SC att kunna svara upp mot de krav som EU st&#xe4;ller p&#xe5; Litauen men &#xe4;ven vara en f&#xf6;rberedande insats inf&#xf6;r det Twinning projekt som startar 2002.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main goal is to conribute to the overall objective of the State Control in Lithuania. Ther overall objective is to enhance the administrative, organiational and technical capacity of the SC, in order to ensure the effective external audit in Lithuania, to enable theis insititution to make the public administration more transparent as well as strengtening the accountablitity in public sector.</narrative>
  </description>
